                    </div>
                                    <div class="body">
                                        <div class="title">Starland District</div>
                                                            <div class="copy"><p><span>Shop for vintage clothing, vinyl records and original art while treating your taste buds to&nbsp;several quaint and quirky cafes in this artsy area.</span></p></div>
                                                            <div class="cta button-outline-container-no-background"><p><a class="button default-button dark-background fancy-button button-outline" aria-label="learn more about Starland District" href="/starland-district">Learn More</a></p></div>
                                      </div>                </div>              </div>            </div>
