                    </div>
                                    <div class="body">
                                        <div class="title">Moon River District</div>
                                                            <div class="copy"><p><span>Nature, history and the coast combine for a trifecta of experiences in Savannah's Lowcountry, just 20 minutes outside of downtown.</span></p></div>
                                                            <div class="cta button-outline-container-no-background"><p><a class="button default-button dark-background fancy-button button-outline" aria-label="learn more about Moon River District" href="/moon-river-district">Learn More</a></p></div>
