                    </div>
                                    <div class="body">
                                        <div class="title">Tybee Island</div>
                                                            <div class="copy"><p>Featuring five pristine beaches, Tybee Island serves up fresh seafood and beach town favorites, just minutes from downtown Savannah.&nbsp;</p></div>
                                                            <div class="cta button-outline-container-no-background"><p><a class="button default-button dark-background fancy-button button-outline" aria-label="learn more about Tybee Island" href="/tybee-island-savannahs-beach">Learn More</a></p></div>
